im]`depends_on` frontmatter list. While a project has an open [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]prerequisite or a future `scheduled` date, `^prj` and every open [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]task in its note are Blocked `[?]`. No Blocked task keeps a Task [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Link under today's open Pomodoros: links are consumed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](prerequisites promoted, link removed, emptied Pomodoro deleted). [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob task reconcile` auto-fixes existing notes such as [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`job_apply_to_databricks.md`, and the Ctrl+Shift+P and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`create-project-note-from-task` keymaps write the new model.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]13[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]prj_task_dep_links.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/prj_task_dep_links.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-6s[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-6s/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project-dependency contract and PD vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: add docs/task-dependencies.md §13 (storage, R0 hoist, ^prj [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]R-rules, inherited Blocked, consumption, guards) with PD vectors, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]amend the sections it makes false.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared Rust project-dependency model[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-model: depends_on reader and splice writer, project recognition, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]openness split, and pure project/effective block reasons in bob-cli, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with PDP/PDW unit vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]depends_on reconciliation in bob task reconcile[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-reconcile-deps[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-reconcile-deps: R0 hoist of ^prj Depends-On lines, ^prj R-rules [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]driven by the property (R2 exception, D3 drop), implicit edges in R7 and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]promotion, outputs and PDR tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project-inherited Blocked and blocked-link consumption in [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]reconcile[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-reconcile-block[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-reconcile-deps[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-reconcile-block: project reasons in the transition loop, ^prj never [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]promoted, consumption of links to Blocked tasks plus empty-Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]removal, outputs, help text, and a read-only live dry run.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close and recovery paths respect project blocking[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-close[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-close: successors keep residents of a still-blocked project Blocked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and recover residents when their ^prj recovers; recovery parity and PDC [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture & on ^prj, project graph edges, and promotion guards[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-capture-deps[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-capture-deps: capture & with a ^prj dependent writes depends_on and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocks the project, implicit member edges in cycle checks, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan_promotions never raises ^prj.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture never links a Blocked task[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-capture-links[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-capture-deps[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-capture-links: link-toggle consumption at every plan_task_link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]caller and unlinked [?] results for new tasks in blocked projects, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scheduled @route:id, and blocked + projects.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation-hotkeys project-dependency model and recovery gate[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-model: JS depends_on reader/splice, project block state, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project-aware recovery index, ^prj never promoted, and opt-in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]empty-entry removal in the deferred Pomodoro cleanup.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ctrl+Shift+P Depends on for ^prj[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-stage[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-stage: project-dependencies descriptor and stage on ^prj, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-transaction writer that blocks residents and removes their links, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commitment transfer, removal recovery, and API routes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  10 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project conversion, project schedules, and task moves[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-convert-move[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-stage[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-convert-move: create-project-note-from-task maps Depends-On to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]depends_on both ways, project schedule paths apply the project rule, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+Shift+M into or out of a blocked project.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  11 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]task-status-cycler and block-id-prompt[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins-compat[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins-compat: cycler member recovery and refusal to hand-unblock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project-blocked tasks; block-id-prompt consumes instead of force-linking[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dependency- or project-blocked targets.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  12 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install bob before plugins, verify the auto-fix, and [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n       [bold #D7AFFF]blocked.md[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-reconcile-block, cli-close, cli-capture-links, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]nav-convert-move, plugins-compat[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: install bob on this host and the MacBook before syncing plugins[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]there, verify the Databricks auto-fix, and add blocked.md's PROJECT [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  13 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Glossary, decision record, supersession marks, and docs sweep[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-reconcile-block, cli-close, cli-capture-links, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]nav-convert-move, plugins-compat[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: update the task-dependency-link and project-task glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]terms, add the project-deps decision record, mark the two records it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]partly supersedes, and sweep docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-6s","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-6s.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7ad6e99ddfdc26e592b856846d2b28b6","started_at":"2026-10-12T12:36:03.654606+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"b7c3265d4338ca7d4110a759bb841763eaff22840fb340d83eec7d80cd08e22a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6s.12/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"f034a2586ea0f629a9bc8069ecc924952bf04d44a8eda138db17361571ad57d3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6s.12/meta.json","size_bytes":753},"prompt":{"digest":"95254b3550b8d15f14cfcadb9fe16b07648f4bda06d16cd462d33b9b2f479aa4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6s.12/prompt.md","size_bytes":322},"state":{"digest":"204af7489a82fe4c1d62bb2fcd079a53affc34522df6e192fc76c8d8620133a1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6s.12/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6s.12","local_name":"bob-cli-6s.12","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-6s","agent_clan_generation":"20261012083506","bead_id":"bob-cli-6s.12","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-6s","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-6s.12","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads